============================================================
1. LOCAL ENVIRONMENT SETUP
============================================================

Requirements:
- Node.js LTS (20.x recommended)
- pnpm or npm (pnpm preferred)
- GitHub CLI (optional)
- VS Code with React/TS plugins

Clone the repo:
git clone https://github.com/koc-council/frontend.git
cd frontend

Checkout the dev branch:
git checkout dev

============================================================
2. INITIALIZE THE REACT PROJECT
============================================================

Use Vite + React + TypeScript:

pnpm create vite . --template react-ts

Install dependencies:
pnpm install

Add required libraries:
pnpm add react-router-dom axios zustand
pnpm add @tanstack/react-query
pnpm add clsx
pnpm add tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer -D
pnpm add eslint prettier -D
